      "description": "Do Hair Loss Shampoos Really Work — practical guidance from ManHair, Orange County's non-surgical hair replacement studio.",
      "image": "https://www.manhaironline.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/1_20220730_001109_0000.png",
      "type": "article",
      "url": "https://www.manhaironline.com/do-hair-loss-shampoos-really-work/",
