    "excerpt": "Healthy, full and shiny hair plays a big role in an individual’s self esteem and is what every man wants to have and keep as they continue to age. However, hair loss is becoming a major problem in man",
    "category": null,
    "datePublished": "2025-07-10T14:00:00+00:00",
    "dateModified": "2025-07-10T14:00:00+00:00",
    "bodyHtml": "<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://www.manhaironline.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/8DA43B73-5B91-4A50-9809-59394833C68F-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3238\" srcset=\"https://www.manhaironline.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/8DA43B73-5B91-4A50-9809-59394833C68F-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.manhaironline.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/8DA43B73-5B91-4A50-9809-59394833C68F-300x300.png 300w, https://www.manhaironline.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/8DA43B73-5B91-4A50-9809-59394833C68F-150x150.png 150w, https://www.manhaironline.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/8DA43B73-5B91-4A50-9809-59394833C68F-768x768.png 768w, https://www.manhaironline.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/8DA43B73-5B91-4A50-9809-59394833C68F-600x600.png 600w, https://www.manhaironline.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/8DA43B73-5B91-4A50-9809-59394833C68F-100x100.png 100w, https://www.manhaironline.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/8DA43B73-5B91-4A50-9809-59394833C68F.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Healthy, full and shiny hair plays a big role in an individual’s self esteem and is what every man wants to have and keep as they continue to age. However, hair loss is becoming a major problem in many men’s lives, and often makes them feel upset and unconfident of themselves. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>So, what are your options if you’re experiencing hair loss?</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At present, there are two solutions to hair loss: <a href=\"https://www.manhaironline.com\">Non Surgical Hair Replacement</a> and <a href=\"https://www.webmd.com/skin-problems-and-treatments/hair-loss/hair-transplants\">Surgical Hair Transplant</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hair Transplants have been a traditional technique since the 80’s, and remains a popular option for Men that suffer from male pattern baldness. But, just because it’s been around that long doesn’t mean that it’s the best and most cost effective option for you; especially when there’s other non-surgical options out there.&nbsp;<br><em>So before you commit, let’s go through a few </em><strong><em>Cons</em></strong><em> of getting a hair transplant.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1. It’s Unlikely That You’ll Have Just One Hair Transplant In Your Life</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yes, you read that right! It’s not a one-and-done type of solution.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Typically, the average hair transplant patient will have around two to four hair transplant surgeries during their lifetime. When you receive the surgery you’re only replacing the initial lost hair; it does nothing for the hairs that will continue to fall out in the future.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Which brings us to our next point.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2. A Hair Transplant Isn’t Going To Stop You From Losing Hair</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Sorry to be the bearer of ‘bad hair’ news but hair transplant surgery is not going to cure your hair loss condition permanently.&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://www.aad.org/public/diseases/hair-loss/treatment/male-pattern-hair-loss-treatment\">Male pattern baldness</a> is genetic and progressive, so as your body naturally lets go of more of your own native hairs, those areas will subsequently need to be attended to. At that point you’ll wish you listened to the advice in this blog because it will become a vicious never-ending transplant surgery cycle.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>3. Get Ready To Make It Rain Money, Because Hair Transplants Aren’t Cheap!</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Correction: good hair transplants aren’t cheap! The price of a hair transplant will depend largely on the amount of hair you’re moving, but it generally ranges from $4,000 to $15,000.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Also, it’s good to keep in mind that majority of insurance plans do not cover Hair Transplant Surgery, so this will become a significant ongoing investment.</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>4. You Will Have Scars.</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Do not be conned into believing when a practitioner promises a scarless hair transplant. Granted, medical science has vastly improved techniques over the years but scarring – <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7646428/\">permanent scarring</a>– with hair transplants is a fact of life.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>5. Only You Can Be Your Hair Donor.</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Unfortunately, your hair follicles don’t regenerate, which means that hair cannot be taken from another donor and transplanted into your scalp.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You may be thinking..What about if I have an identical twin or family member that doesn’t mind donating some of their hair?&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Unfortunately, even if the hairs were from a person related to you, it’s still impossible. Your immune system would immediately recognize the hair follicles as foreign bodies and attack them. Then, the newly Transplanted hair would just fall out again and you’d be right back where you started.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>6) Surgery Feels Like A Last Resort..but it’s not!</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To some, hair transplant surgery might seem like the Holy Grail of hair loss treatments because most think it’s a one time permanent solution. It’s Not!</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There are other therapies out therr that could be highly effective for your situation- like a hair replacement system.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Unlike getting a surgical transplant, you don’t need surgery when you choose a hair replacement system. You also don’t have to put up with the risk of infection, scarring, and the anesthetic dangers that come with surgery.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Pro’s for getting a <a href=\"https://www.manhaironline.com\">Hair Replacement System</a> are piling up here!!!</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The <a href=\"https://www.manhaironline.com/faq/\">major advantage </a>&nbsp;of the non-surgical hair replacement system is that it can offer immediate results! A hair transplant usually takes 6 to 7 months to heal, whereas a Hair Replacement system is completely customizable, cost effective and immediate!</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Just Google Hair Replacements Systems in your area and set up a consultation.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you’re located in Orange County, CA, <a href=\"https://www.manhaironline.com\">Man Hair</a> can help give you the perfect hair replacement system so that you can regain your confidence, and look your absolute best.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are the leading solution for <a href=\"https://www.manhaironline.com/how-it-works/\">men’s hair replacement systems</a> and offer the highest quality of hair at the most affordable prices.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.manhaironline.com/contact/\">Contact us today</a> where you can book a 100% free discovery call with one of our hair specialists or call us directly at 1(904)458-7592.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We’re ready to help change your life….without you having to go under the knife.</p>"
