      "title": "Can Depression Symptoms Cause Male Pattern Baldness",
      "description": "Men’s Hair Loss And The Depression It Causes — practical guidance from ManHair, Orange County's non-surgical hair replacement studio.",
      "image": "https://www.manhaironline.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/PhotoRoom-20220718_031450.png",
      "type": "article",
